[gd_scene load_steps=8 format=3 uid="uid://unittilemaplayerscenetiles"]

; The one variable: a TileMapLayer instantiates the scene of each cell that names a scene tile of
; a TileSetScenesCollectionSource (tile_map_layer.cpp:1569-1659). Every other tile golden draws
; atlas sources only, so none can show a regression in an instance's place, flip or draw order.
; Rows: four orientations of a Node2D root, a Control root and a root with its own position, a
; display_placeholder tile (no disc without Gizmos), three cells that draw nothing, and two
; overlapping instances (the later one on top) beside an authored child.

